---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Get WorkLog for Android" description="Download the WorkLog Android app and keep your freelance work records organized on your phone.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container narrow"><span class="eyebrow">GET STARTED WITH WORKLOG</span><h1>Your work log, ready for Android.</h1><p class="hero-lede">WorkLog is an Android mobile app for keeping your freelance work, clients, time, invoices and finances organized.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section section-space"><div class="container download-grid download-grid-single">
    <article class="download-card download-card-primary"><span class="download-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="6" y="2.5" width="12" height="19" rx="2"/><path d="M10 18.5h4"/></svg></span><span class="eyebrow">ANDROID APP</span><h2>APK release is being prepared</h2><p>We’ll publish the signed Android installer and version notes here when the first release is ready.</p><button class="button button-disabled" type="button" disabled aria-disabled="true">Download not available yet</button></article>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section solution-section"><div class="container narrow"><h2>How app updates will work</h2><p>For direct APK releases, you’ll download and install the new version over the current app—no uninstall needed when the package ID and signing key stay the same. We’ll show the APK version and release notes on this page.</p></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
